></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COMBAT PHASE</h2>The combat phase follows the stealth phase once you arrive inside the generator room. The combat controls are then unlocked and allows you to jump and use your weapon or your powers.<br><i>5 type of cyborgs</i> <br>Different type of cyborgs will appear: some are easy to fight some are really hard.<br>You start each combat phase with some of your fighting skills unlocked. You can unlock them by eliminating more cyborgs at the same time, the rage bar will be completely full and you will be able to unleash powerful combos and deal more damage.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVAL CHALLENGE</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009270/extras/5a846bf9246c59547c92e485b06652eb.poster.avif?t=1725879410\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009270/extras/5a846bf9246c59547c92e485b06652eb.webm?t=1725879410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009270/extras/5a846bf9246c59547c92e485b06652eb.mp4?t=1725879410\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>FIght an illimited number of cyborgs and allows you to test your skills and improve them at the same time. <br>Illimited fight= illimited fun!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009270/extras/9345eb2ae49e20e5e47fae14d1f2f175.poster.avif?t=1725879410\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009270/extras/9345eb2ae49e20e5e47fae14d1f2f175.webm?t=1725879410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009270/extras/9345eb2ae49e20e5e47fae14d1f2f175.mp4?t=1725879410\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HISTORY</h2>You are a female agent, one of the most powerful one. You have the ability to manipulate a cybernetic power which allows you to make power and fast movement.<br>As a consequence, you have been send to Japan at the shinken batoryu sword school. Since then, you cut and dash any ennemy of the public order.<br>In your arsenal, you can count on a powerful energetic sword that can cut everything including humans or cyborg...That will be helpful soon<br><i>CYBORG UPRISING</i><br>The biggest facility for cyborg manufacturing, EXE corp, has fallen in chaos because of a cyborg uprising. The cause is not clear but it seems that one cyborg has been manufactured with a new AI system which allows to feel.....emotions. This cyborg, we call it the original has taken control of all the cyborgs inside the facility and it is now menacing all the city.<br><br>The media has called this event: the Takeover!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CONTROLS</h2>You basically just need a mouse and a keyboard. The game is compatible with controller during the stealth and the fight mode.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SPECIAL FEATURE</h2>Dynamic clothes system:<br>What happens when you take too much damages? You lose all your clothes except your lingerie!",
